 "category_zh": "山地风光",
 "category_en": "Mountain scenery",
 "intro_zh": "玉龙雪山由十三峰组成，由北向南呈纵向排列，延绵近50公里，东西宽约13公里。玉龙雪山不仅气势磅礴，而且秀丽挺拔，造型玲珑，皎洁如晶莹的玉石，灿烂如十三把利剑，在碧蓝天幕的映衬下，像一条银色的玉龙在作永恒的飞舞，故名玉龙山。",
 "intro_en": "Jade Dragon Snow Mountain (simplified Chinese: 玉龙雪山; traditional Chinese: 玉龍雪山; pinyin: Yùlóng Xuěshān; Naxi: Jingv'lv or Ngv'lv bbei jjuq) is a mountain massif or small mountain range in Yulong Naxi Autonomous County, Lijiang, in Yunnan province, China. Its highest peak is named Shanzidou or Shan-Tzu-tou (扇子陡) and it is 5,596 m (18,360 ft) above sea level.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
